OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day with plenty of sunny
OL,6,Fspells and some patchy cloud.
OL,7,FInitially breezy at times near the
OL,8,Fcoast, but winds easing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with mostly clear skies,
OL,13,Fleading to a chilly night with light
OL,14,Fwinds. A grass frost is possible by
OL,15,Fdawn for any prone rural spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FPlenty of sunshine to start,
OL,18,Fbut cloud building from the northwest
OL,19,Fduring the afternoon. Remaining
OL,20,Flargely dry across the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
