OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and sunny spells
OL,7,FTuesday. Outbreaks of rain expected
OL,8,Ffor a time Wednesday. Fine and sunny
OL,9,FThursday. Warm by day, but chilly
OL,10,FWednesday and Thursday nights.
